      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I return the hug, lingering for a moment to inhale her scent. Vanilla. I could never get sick of that",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4297
        }
      ],
      "words": 20
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“We're more than friends, silly. I was his first girlfriend! Such a shame how that ended though.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6379
        }
      ],
      "words": 17
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Macie and I dated in high school. Just for a few months. And it didn't end nicely.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7960
        }
      ],
      "words": 17
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“She shoved her hands down my pants, and was",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 17365
        },
        {
          "text": "disappointed with what she found,” I say quickly",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 17409
        }
      ],
      "words": 16
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Glancing at Eden, I rip the band-aid off. “I was too drunk to get her off me.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 17518
        }
      ],
      "words": 17
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“But it still happened to you. And it still affects you. I should have ripped her face off when I had the chance.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 17862
        }
      ],
      "words": 23
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "She was the top dog at our school, and I was just her dorky plaything. I didn't",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 18132
        },
        {
          "text": "I couldn't say anything",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 18211
        }
      ],
      "words": 20
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“I'm happy you told me, Oliver. It gives me a chance to understand you better.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 18307
        }
      ],
      "words": 15
    },
    {
      "block": "原句10",
      "no": 10,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“See? Not my friend. Not my friend at all,” I laugh, which makes her laugh too",
          "ok": true,
